ues/104579#issuecomment-2751402880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104579","id":2751402880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j_xOA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:12:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:12:12Z","body":"I don't think this is a bug, access to null variables will crash code and not sure the editor is expected to catch this safely","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751402880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755415932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104579#issuecomment-2755415932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104579","id":2755415932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kPE98","user":{"login":"VojtaStruhar","id":49688205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njg4MjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49688205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar","html_url":"https://github.com/VojtaStruhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T18:34:34Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T18:34:34Z","body":"Fair enough. The documentation clearly says that with tool script you are playing with fire a little bit :)\n\nI was curious and made some debug prints:\n\n```gdscript\nprint(\"Teleport area: \", teleport_area)\nprint(\"is_valid: \", is_instance_valid(teleport_area))\nprint(\"Collider: \", teleport_collider)\nprint(\"is_valid: \", is_instance_valid(teleport_collider))\n```\n\nIn the \"invalid state\" it results in this being printed:\n\n```\nTeleport area: <null>\nis_valid: false\nCollider: <Freed Object>\nis_valid: false\n```\n\nThat means godot _knows_ if something is freed! I was thinking maybe something along the lines of `is_instance_valid` check in C++ would prevent this issue. I'm not too familiar with the engine internals, no idea how complex that would be.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755415932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3226799173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104579#issuecomment-3226799173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104579","id":3226799173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AVQxF","user":{"login":"Baba-Yagan","id":145987683,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLOYYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145987683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan","html_url":"https://github.com/Baba-Yagan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Baba-Yagan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T05:37:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T05:37:22Z","body":"i just found out about this crash myself, if i understand it's not a problem with the null vars but with the queue free:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tqueue_free()\n```\n\nthis will crash godot when you open a scene that's connected to this script.\nyou can add the following to  _ready() to fix this from happening\n```gdscript\n\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\treturn\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3226799173/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]